 word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 19.2pt; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2025-1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학기 대학원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">산업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">교육 및 컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">강의평가 시행과 관련한 사항을</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">안내하오니 아래의 내용을 참고하여 강의평가가 원활히 진행될 수 있도록 참여하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">강의평가의 목적</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학생에게 한 학기 동안 받은 교육에 대한 평가를 스스로 함으로써 강의에&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">대한 자신의 의견과 요구사항을 학교에 표현할 수 있는 기회를 제공하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">강의의&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.7pt; font-size: 12pt;\">주체인 교수에게는 자신의 강의에 대한 피드백 기회를 제공함으로써</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">교육의 질을 향상하고자 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.1pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 81.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -81.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\"