;\">평가방법&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 바탕; font-size: 12pt;\">원킷 통합정보시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학사&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">강의평가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">→&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">강의평가</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 17.2pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -17.2pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">7.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">안내사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 24.8pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -24.8pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">본 설문에 대한 익명성은 보장되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학생이 평가한 결과는 성적부여에 영향을</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">미치지 않도록</span></u><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">성적 확정 이후</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">해당 교수에게 열람됩니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 22.9pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -22.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">강의평가 기간 중에 평가를 실시하지 않은 학생은 해당 학기 성적열람기간에 성적을 열람할 수 없습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">금오공과대학교 강의평가지침 제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">3</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">조&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2025. 5.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-bottom: 4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">금오공과대학교 대학원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">일반</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">산업</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">교육 및 컨설팅</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
